id: pm-gh1622
title: "GH-1622: investigate pm-presets SDK-loading fault blocking daily release"
description: Auto Release run 40813895480 on 2026-10-29 stops at Sentry PM-CLI-3Q. Two SimulationRefusal sdk_unavailable events originate in the pm-presets package SDK loader on pm-cli 2026.10.25. Investigate package resolution and refusal classification without clearing the alert or bypassing release gates before verification.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
