closed_at: "2026-10-30T22:09:11.543Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-30T22:09:11.543Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 120
acceptance_criteria: Identify and verify the package SDK-loading cause; repair in the owning package and verify the installed consumer; resolve the Sentry issue only with remediation evidence; run the ordinary release gates and preserve one automatic cut per UTC day
parent: pm-5oj5
risk: medium
confidence: high
resolution: pm-presets #181 resolves the SDK from the canonical location of each anchor (symlinked global bin first for the invoked entry); pm-presets 2026.10.30 published; Sentry PM-CLI-3Q resolved with a remediation note; pm-cli 2026.10.30 cut by the ordinary Auto Release pipeline and published.
expected_result: "Package SDK resolution and typed refusal handling are verified in the owning package, Sentry shows no recurrence after remediation, and normal release preparation passes without weakening the one-auto-release-per-day guard."
actual_result: "Installed consumer with hosts 2026.10.25 and 2026.10.28 plus pm-presets 2026.10.30 exits 0 for plan and simulate without extension node_modules; Sentry gate ok with 0 blocking; Auto Release run 41117123853 and Release run 41121721832 succeeded (12/12 registry acceptance, advertised v2026.10.30); blocker retry 41135838157 found the existing same-day tag and cut nothing; exactly one v2026.10.30 tag."
